- [PARKED] "Pardot v5 REST tier — 18 live endpoints + complete Bearer bypass (CRITICAL)": **contradicted** — all 18 paths return code 198/404 today; no Wayback snapshot; no Pardot tracking JS on any ElringKlinger site. Prior 85-confidence finding was built on a misattribution of `/api/<object>` behavior to `/api/v5/*`. Downgraded.
