## STEP 6 — LEARNING
- [LEARN] ACCEPTED AUTH @ go.events.elringklinger.com/api/<object> (legacy XML): Bearer token VALUE is never validated on 12 object paths — 3 distinct garbage tokens (`test`,`zzzzzzzzz`,`xyz`) + valid-format 18-char BU all return identical err 201 "Business Unit not found or inactive", proving the Authorization value is ignored in the auth decision. Chain 182(no auth)→181(missing BU)→201(BU unknown) fully mapped.
- [LEARN] REJECTED AUTH @ go.events.elringklinger.com/api/v5/*: All 18 "previously live" REST endpoints return `{"code":198,"message":"Endpoint not found"}` (404) today. Prior "complete Bearer auth bypass + 18 live v5 endpoints" hypothesis is DISPROVEN — v5 REST tier is not deployed on this host; the earlier 85-conf finding conflated legacy XML (`/api/<object>`) behavior with `(/api/v5/<object>)`.
