- [LEARN] ACCEPTED OTHER @ elring.com/elring.de/elringklinger.de: All three sites use Matomo (elringklinger.matomo.cloud, SiteId 12, container_3bNKj3Et); NONE embed Pardot tracking JS (no piAId/piHostname/pd.js/tracker) — so the BU ID is not obtainable from public tracking scripts, closing the previously-assumed low-hanging path.

## STEP 7 — RISK
- [RISK] elringklinger: 48/100. Flagship claim downgraded: v5 REST tier disproven (0 live endpoints); only concrete finding is a reproducible missing-Bearer-value-validation gap on the legacy Pardot XML API (12 objects) that is HIGH-severity *only if* ElringKlinger's 18-char BU ID is obtained — currently unavailable from any public source (no Pardot tracking JS; not indexed). Smartcard backend down 40h+. 10/13 inventory hosts unreachable. Remaining live surface is thin; the legacy Pardot XML API token-validation flaw is reportable as MEDIUM, with a conditional chain to HIGH.هنگام investigating verify BU ID without touching customer data.

Findings chain is reproducible with only fabricated tokens/BU (`0Uv510000000000000` is a synthetic 18-char value, no real ElringKlinger PII touched, read-only GETs, <=1rps). Safe to report the missing-Bearer-validation as a design flaw; data-access proof must wait for a legitimately-discovered BU ID.
